{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_unleashed_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} puts a new leash on a nearby unleashed person and ties the free end to a nearby point. Not for tying an already-collared person (use Change leash) and not for holding the leash yourself (use the hold/hang action).
Available targets: {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}. Never pick anyone not listed.
